{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"球状集"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"球状集"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p><strong>球状集</strong> (globular set) 是可由如下对象"},{"Local":{"url":"探测","text":"探测"}},{"Plain":"的结构:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>点;</li>\n<li>线段;</li>\n<li>两个线段 $\\bullet \\rightrightarrows \\bullet$ 围成的 $2$-胞腔;</li>\n<li>…</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯集","text":"单纯集"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}